<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 6.5 bln levs 56-day T-bills Oct 7.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 6.5 bln levs 56-day T-bills Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 6.5 billion levs of 56-day floater coupon T-bills at an auction on Monday, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>The issue was offered with no minimum acceptable price set in advance by the ministry, a BNB statement said.</p>
<p>The coupon was set equal to the BNB's central interest rate (CIR) for the period to maturity. The CIR is now set at an annual 300 percent.</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3018996028</p>
<p> Type		   Floater coupon</p>
<p> Par value	    6.5 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	 October 7, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date	   October 9, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date	December 4, 1996</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
